<title>FINLAND: FINNISH RAW WOOD PRICES RISE FURTHER IN NOV - METLA.</title>
<headline>FINNISH RAW WOOD PRICES RISE FURTHER IN NOV - METLA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish raw wood stumpage prices</p>
<p>rose in November (weeks 45-48), building on their rises in</p>
<p>September and October, the Finnish Forest Research Institute</p>
<p>METLA said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Pulpwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	     Nov '96    Oct '96     1995	H2 '95	H1 '95</p>
<p> Pine	  96.40	95.90    93.00	 93.20	 92.90</p>
<p> Spruce     123.60     123.30   109.70	109.00	110.20</p>
<p> Birch	 93.40	93.00    98.20	 98.00	 98.40</p>
<p>Logwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	     Nov '96    Oct '96     1995	 H2 '95     H1 '95</p>
<p> Pine	 247.00     245.50   247.10	 244.60     249.30</p>
<p> Spruce     204.90     203.60   197.60	 192.40     201.00</p>
<p> Birch	245.40     245.40   244.10	 240.70     246.70</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 235</p>
</text>
